Fri Oct  9 17:45:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Ship chrome-sandbox 0755 instead of setuid (rpmlint SUID tags are
  in BlockedFilters: no filter or registration can silence them, and
  third-party paths can never join the whitelist; userns covers the
  sandbox, same pattern as opencode-desktop)

